---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import '../styles/globals.css'
---

<Base
  title="Laso — Your Health, Understood"
  description="Apple Health shows your metrics one at a time. Laso reads them together — your heart rate, sleep, HRV, activity, and 50 others — so you can see what's actually going on. All on your iPhone."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">

    <!-- ════════ NAV ════════ -->
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav-blur fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-100/60">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="#" class="text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark">Laso</a>
        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7">
          <a href="#problem" class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Why</a>
          <a href="#features" class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Features</a>
          <a href="#who" class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Who It's For</a>
          <a href="#pricing" class="text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary hover:text-apple-dark transition-colors">Pricing</a>
        </div>
        <button data-download="nav" class="bg-apple-dark text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 hover:bg-black transition-colors cursor-pointer">
          Download
        </button>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
    <section data-section="hero" class="hero-gradient pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-apple-blue mb-4 tracking-wide">For Apple Watch owners</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-[1.08]">
        Your watch collects the data.<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">We connect the dots.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-apple-secondary max-w-xl mx-auto text-balance leading-relaxed">
        Apple Health shows you each metric alone. Laso reads them together so you actually know if you're doing okay or not.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <button data-download="hero" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-apple-dark text-white font-medium rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] hover:bg-black transition-colors active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5">
            <path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.8-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11Z"/>
          </svg>
          Download for iOS
        </button>
        <span class="text-sm text-apple-secondary">Free &middot; No account needed</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ THE PROBLEM ════════ -->
    <section id="problem" data-section="problem" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          Your watch tracks everything.<br/>But what does it actually mean?
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-[15px] md:text-base text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          You wear your Apple Watch every day. It records your heart rate, sleep stages, steps, HRV, respiratory rate, blood oxygen, and dozens more. But Apple Health shows you each metric in isolation a number here, a chart there. You're left wondering: am I doing okay? Is this trend normal for me? Should I be worried?
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">50+</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">metrics your watch collects</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">0</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">that connect them together</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">?</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">"Am I actually healthy?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT LASO DOES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="what-laso-does" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          One app. Three ways to understand your health.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Laso reads your HealthKit data and turns it into something useful.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

          <!-- Today Tab -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 md:p-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7 text-white">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-blue uppercase tracking-wider">Today</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Your daily health check-in</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-apple-blue mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Recovery Score</strong> &mdash; are you rested and ready, or running on fumes?</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-apple-blue mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Body Insights</strong> &mdash; what your body is telling you today, in plain language</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-apple-blue mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Trends</strong> &mdash; what's improving, what's declining, what's stable</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-apple-blue mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Health Risks</strong> &mdash; early flags when multiple signals shift together</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-apple-blue mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Weekly Review</strong> &mdash; summary of your past week in 10 seconds</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Live Tab -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 md:p-8" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7 text-white">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Live</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Real-time vitals from your watch</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Live Heart Rate</strong> &mdash; current BPM with heart rate zone and 30-min session stats</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Blood Oxygen &amp; Respiratory Rate</strong> &mdash; latest readings with freshness indicators</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Activity Rings</strong> &mdash; Move, Exercise, Stand progress with steps and distance</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Last Workout</strong> &mdash; type, duration, calories at a glance</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] text-apple-secondary/70">Requires Apple Watch. Pro feature.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Explore Tab -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 md:p-8" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7 text-white">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0-1 3m8.5-3 1 3m0 0 .5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0-.5 1.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Explore</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Deep dive into your data</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Health Score</strong> &mdash; one number (0-100) from all your metrics, with letter grade</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Score Breakdown</strong> &mdash; see exactly which metrics push your score up or down</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Correlations</strong> &mdash; discover what affects what (e.g. sleep quality vs next-day HRV)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">Historical Context</strong> &mdash; year-over-year, seasonal patterns, all-time records</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong class="text-apple-dark">7 Categories</strong> &mdash; Heart, Sleep, Activity, Body, Respiratory, Mindfulness, Mobility</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ SCORE SHOWCASE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="score" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          One score. Seven categories. Your baselines.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Not a generic formula. The score adapts to your body &mdash; stable metrics get amplified, volatile ones get dampened. And you can see exactly what's driving it.
        </p>

        <!-- Score ring -->
        <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center">
          <div class="score-showcase">
            <div class="score-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative w-44 h-44 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 md:w-64 md:h-64 mx-auto">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 280 280" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="ring-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0071e3"/>
                    <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#34d399"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#06b6d4"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <filter id="ring-glow">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur"/>
                    <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
                  </filter>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#e8e8ed" stroke-width="12"/>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="url(#ring-grad)" stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-dasharray="753.98"
                  stroke-dashoffset="98"
                  filter="url(#ring-glow)"
                  class="origin-center -rotate-90 score-ring-animate"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                <span class="score-counter text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-dark" data-target="87">0</span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-apple-secondary mt-1">out of 100</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Category pills -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-red-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Heart</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">RHR &middot; HRV &middot; Recovery</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:50ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Sleep</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">Duration &middot; Deep &middot; REM</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-green-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Activity</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">Steps &middot; Calories &middot; Exercise</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:150ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-orange-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Body</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">Weight &middot; BMI &middot; Temp</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Respiratory</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">VO2 &middot; SpO2 &middot; Resp Rate</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:250ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-purple-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Mindfulness</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">Minutes &middot; Daylight</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-center" style="transition-delay:300ms">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-teal-500 rounded-full mx-auto opacity-80"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Mobility</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-apple-secondary leading-snug">Speed &middot; Symmetry</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-8 text-xs text-apple-secondary/60">Sample data &mdash; your score is calculated from your own metrics</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT ════════ -->
    <section id="features" data-section="features" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          What you actually get.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Not buzzwords. Here's what the app does every day.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

          <div class="section-reveal feature-card border border-gray-100">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Personal Baselines</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">62 bpm might be textbook normal, but high for you. Every insight compares against your own history, not population averages.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal feature-card border border-gray-100" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Multi-Metric Alerts</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">When your HRV, sleep quality, and respiratory rate shift together, Laso flags it. Individual metrics might look fine &mdash; the combination is what matters.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal feature-card border border-gray-100" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-violet-50 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-600 mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.19 8.688a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 1.242 7.244l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364-6.364l1.757-1.757m13.35-.622 1.757-1.757a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6.364-6.364l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1.242 7.244"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Correlations</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Finds connections between your metrics automatically. "When your deep sleep drops, your HRV tends to follow 2 days later." 35 metric pairs analyzed.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal feature-card border border-gray-100" style="transition-delay:240ms">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 0 1 0-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Transparent Scoring</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">"Heart rate recovery added +8 points. Sleep consistency cost you -12." See exactly what's pulling your score up or down. No black box.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal feature-card border border-gray-100" style="transition-delay:320ms">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Historical Context</h3>
